--- !u!114 &1556376049002585309
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 7669136077293923538}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 993d8d8b34a954049b05eb7b4bbba012, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Game::Npc
  npcName: Old Moss
  portrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 54206c283e3b3408797cdc46ae10ca6b, type: 3}
  voice: {fileID: 8300000, guid: ddc2547c5cd8e4737ba1d7d7fd699ec9, type: 3}
  giftSound: {fileID: 8300000, guid: a142d3c7adcfa46989d2fae3161d654d, type: 3}
  conversations:
  - requires: 
    notIf: met:Old Moss
    sets: met:Old Moss
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Mmm? Oh! A visitor. Pardon me, I was just watering the lupins. Old Moss, they call me. Gardener of the Whispering Woods.
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: The trees are all wearing nightcaps!
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Aye. The Grey Gloom's drizzle sent the whole wood to sleep, three hundred years ago. They've been snoring ever since.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Give four of the sleepy ones a good zap of magic, {hero}. Nicely, mind. They wake up ever so cheerful.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Wake four, and come and tell me. I might have something for you.
  - requires: trees_woken>=4
    notIf: thanked:moss
    sets: thanked:moss
    giveGold: 25
    giveItem: clover_charm
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Hear that? That's the sound of a wood waking up. Birdsong! I'd forgotten what it sounded like.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Here, a Lucky Clover Charm. It grew where the first tree woke. Wear it, and your magic will come back quicker.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'Now, if you''re brave: the big red mushroom in the Grove, east of the meadow, is Mother Mushroom. She''s been guarding something precious since the Gloom came.'
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: She isn't wicked, just very cross. Dodge her red circles, and mind the spores.
  - requires: cleared:Woods4
    notIf: moss:cheered
    sets: moss:cheered
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: You did it! I felt the whole wood sigh. Mother Mushroom is herself again.
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: And the Fairy Lantern! It's yours, {hero}. It lights up the dark places. There's a hollow south of the meadow that's been dark ever since the Gloom.
  - requires: 
    notIf: trees_woken>=4
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 0
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Four sleepy trees, dear. Look for the ones in the blue nightcaps, and give each a good zap of magic.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: 'A wood''s like a dragon: grumpy until it''s had its nap, and twice as grumpy if you wake it early.'
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Why did the mushroom get invited to every party?
    - heroSpeaks: 1
      text: Why?
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Because he was a real FUNGI! Heh heh heh.
  - requires: found:toilet_frog
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Is that a frog hat? Splendid. Frogs are the best gardeners. They eat the slugs.
  - requires: 
    notIf: 
    sets: 
    giveGold: 0
    giveItem: 
    smallTalk: 1
    lines:
    - heroSpeaks: 0
      text: Pots! Folk leave them lying about the Woods. Break one and see what's inside. Gently, mind.
  talkOffset: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0}
  flipbook: {fileID: 8579098520395143111}
  idleFrames:
  - {fileID: 508527154, guid: 7e01e18ed60e74e998af11cb7deaaa3a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -885886517, guid: 7e01e18ed60e74e998af11cb7deaaa3a, type: 3}
  talkFrames:
  - {fileID: 1155155591, guid: 7e01e18ed60e74e998af11cb7deaaa3a, type: 3}
  - {fileID: -1718324002, guid: 7e01e18ed60e74e998af11cb7deaaa3a, type: 3}
  idleFps: 2
  talkFps: 6
